From 287095b6aab78f0733ee4ce36af6d6b024b653b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy <andylee77@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] cameras: N803 PTZ (n803_ssc378qe_imx415, Pelco-D head)

SSC378QE + IMX415, 3840x2160 + 1280x720, 5x zoom: its own board DTS, the
Pelco-D head through lensd -P, microSD, a 5-partition flash with its own env
partition. The OEM MAC is per unit: S04oemmac reads it from the overlay, and
none is baked in. The RAPTOR_* keys are in raptor.config. The OEM sensor
tuning is a vendor file and is not included.
